            "content": "<p><strong>Gold Vermeil </strong>- A thick layer of real 18k or 14k gold bonded to solid sterling silver - up to 25x thicker than standard plating. Designed to last, crafted to shine, made to hold meaning.</p><p><strong>Solid 925 sterling silver</strong> - finished with rhodium - a rare metal from the platinum family. This bright, durable layer protects against tarnish and keeps every piece shining beautifully.</p><p><strong>Rhodium Plating </strong>applied to sterling silver. Rhodium is one of the world’s most precious metals, known for its mirror-like shine and exceptional resistance to tarnishing.</p><p><strong>Protective anti-tarnish coating</strong> that helps preserve shine and colour over time. It adds an invisible shield against daily wear, so your jewelry stays as beautiful as the day you received it. </p><p><strong>Conflict-free simulated diamonds,</strong> hand-set promise cubic zirconia for a flawless finish.</p><p><strong>Sparkle Index (Refractive Index)</strong></p><p>Our stones: <strong>2.18 </strong>| Natural diamonds: <strong>2.41</strong></p><p><strong>Durability (MOHS Hardness) </strong></p><p>Our stones: <strong>8.5 </strong>| Natural diamonds: <strong>10</strong></p>"
